FirstMetShenyo: {
	ShenyoName: Shenyo
	L1: It has been a long time since anything living walked in here
	L2: How did you get here?
	OptDead: Died once. When I woke up, I was here
	OptRain: Snatched an umbrella and charged in
	OptDeadLocked: You have not died
	OptRainLocked: Your hands are empty
	A1: ...Back from the dead?
	A2: A rare thing. Though by the look of you, you seem used to it
	B1: Then your luck is not bad at all
	B2: Now it is time to leave
	C1: The umbrella will hold the way open for you. Go back
	C2: That umbrella is yours from now on
}

ShenyoDerivedUmbrella: {
	L1: That umbrella looks like a derived paranormal entity
	Opt1: A derived paranormal entity? Meaning it is a part of you?
	L2: Exactly. I once dismembered my own paranormal form, and the severed fragments revive on their own once enough years go by
	L3: This umbrella intruding on reality, for instance, is a paranormal phenomenon derived from the Kikasa's source
	Opt2: So you are not actually the source of the Kikasa?
	L4: I was, once
	L5: I should have died long ago, but my consciousness woke again inside a paranormal fragment left in this world
	L6: Touch this derived umbrella, and you should be able to enter its ghost domain
	L7: Whether you go is your own business
	L8: If you die in there, I will pull you back with a Restart
}

ShenyoDollGift: {
	L0: I just remembered something worth giving you
	L1: Keep this doll close. It can save your life once
	L2: The one who sewed these was a silly girl. She made a whole pile for someone she liked, though that person could never possibly need them
	L3: Back then I traded with her for quite a few. They make fine gifts for the young ones
}

ShenyoFesterSerpentGift: {
	L0: Things dragged out of the sand look even worse than things rotted in water
	L1: That sludge dripping off it is nothing good either, foul and sticky
	L2: Rinse the umbrella clean when you are done, dried scum is impossible to wipe off
}

ShenyoBossRushGift: {
	L0: Did they all gather back, or did that old thing down in the abyss finally stir?
	L1: Whichever it is, this was never going to be easy
	L2: Stand steady, quit swaying in front of me
	L3: Once this fight is done, the rain outside should finally clear
}

ShenyoCalamityEvilGift: {
	L0: A whole crawling nest that gnaws through flesh and bone, annoying just to look at
	L1: You, though, do not seem to care much about pain
	L2: Be more careful from now on, this umbrella can turn rain, but it cannot turn those vermin
}

ShenyoCultistGift: {
	L0: Muttering on and on outside the door, loud and tiresome
	L1: Whatever he was trying to draw down is nothing good
	L2: Good that you cut it short, before the spectacle got out of hand
}

ShenyoDevourerOfGodsGift: {
	L0: That serpent coiling across the sky, they say it has swallowed gods
	L1: What level a god reaches, I am somewhat curious
	L2: Keep that hard carapace for yourself, you need not bring the flesh for me to see
}

ShenyoDukeFishronGift: {
	L0: A sea pig learning to stir up waves like a man, strange enough
	L1: The temper of water is not for it to boss around
	L2: Shoving it back into the depths was for the best, saves it from splashing around before my eyes
}

ShenyoEmpressGift: {
	L0: Things this blinding hurt my eyes
	L1: There was no need to pick a fight with her in broad daylight, yet you always choose the troublesome path
	L2: You rubbed that glare dim, so I will grant you some skill
}

ShenyoEvilBossGift: {
	L0Worm: That segmented serpent dragged from the mire reeks worse than stagnant water
	L1Worm: An odor heavier than dead ponds, yet you stomach it just fine
	L0Brain: A brain belongs tucked inside bone, splayed open like that it must feel cold
	L1Brain: Filth like that is an eyesore just looking at it
	L2: Good that you finished it, do not come back to me soaked in that stench
}

ShenyoExoAndSCalGift: {
	L0: The pride of artifice and the obsession of a witch, brought together they make quite a pair
	L1: Both sides have been weighed and measured, you did not run in vain today
	L2: From now on in this world, there will hardly be another commotion of this scale
}

ShenyoEyeOfCthulhuGift: {
	L0: Staring all over the night with one giant eye, not even afraid of giving itself a fright
	L1: Glares right at you without a blink, enough to make skin crawl
	L2: Closed now, for the better, saves the eyesore
}

ShenyoGolemGift: {
	L0: A stone pillar from the temple that actually hops around
	L1: Smashed open, it was nothing but an empty shell after all
	L2: You kicked up that spray with your own hands, I did not help you
}

ShenyoKingSlimeGift: {
	L0: A soft puddle of muck, does it even deserve to measure me?
	L1: Bounces eagerly enough, at least
	L2: When you meet truly perilous things later, do not mimic its empty bluster
}

ShenyoSeaShrimpGift: {
	L0: That mantis shrimp hidden beneath the shore, glistening bright, punches hard enough to shatter the water
	L1: Sheds shell after shell, but its temper never softened one bit
	L2: The crack sounded terrifying, but you took it head-on, so your hands know their craft
}

ShenyoMechsGift: {
	L0: Iron chains, searchlights, a steel skeleton, cobbled together like a farce
	L1: The iron stench is heavy, I dislike it, yet you seem unbothered
	L2: Dismantled all at once, you have some patience in you
}

ShenyoMoonLordGift: {
	L0: That massive shadow across the sky has finally broken apart
	L1: Covered in eyes, almost like the curtain of rain beneath this umbrella
	L2: The moonlight tonight looks pleasant enough, take a good look at it for me
}

ShenyoOldDukeGift: {
	L0: That stubborn relic beneath the Sulphurous Sea, temper sourer than acid
	L1: We crossed paths a few times back then, and neither yielded a step
	L2: Finished by your hand this time, count it as settling a score for me
}

ShenyoPlanteraGift: {
	L0: Waking a flower sleeping in the depths was bound to be trouble
	L1: The way those vines thrash and strangle, reminds me of when my umbrella would not close
	L2: Sap stains on your hands are sticky, remember to draw water and wash them clean
}

ShenyoPolterghastGift: {
	L0: Those tattered souls drifting deep in the dungeon, patched together for centuries
	L1: In the end they are kin to what I am, no need to waste pity on them
	L2: Better that they scatter quietly in the water than hang there grieving forever
}

ShenyoQueenBeeOrDeerclopsGift: {
	L0Bee: Sweet as it is, the sting on its tail hurts like fire
	L1Bee: Honey is a fine thing, pity it guarded it so jealously
	L0Deer: That one-eyed brute, stubborn even compared to me
	L1Deer: A withered husk of a hoof, yet it kicks up such a blizzard
	L2: After all that tumbling around, you are not bruised, are you?
}

ShenyoQueenSlimeGift: {
	L0: All soft and pink, quite eager to dress up
	L1: Marching to battle with an entourage, quite the display
	L2: Grand as the display was, it could not withstand a single downpour
}

ShenyoSkeletronGift: {
	L0: Standing watch before the gate all those years, the bones must have gone brittle long ago
	L1: Were it me, I would have abandoned the vigil ages past
	L2: The dungeon door is open, watch your step inside, do not turn foolish like that old servant
}

ShenyoSlimeGodGift: {
	L0: Red and purple stirred into a sludge, yet bold enough to speak of godhood
	L1: Bundling so many messy things into one heap, I suppose it has some depth
	L2: Melted clean away is best, spares the ground from being sullied
}

ShenyoWallOfFleshGift: {
	L0: That massive wall of meat down below, even through the rain I found it stiflingly hot
	L1: Piercing it through rewrote the rules of this world, you struck swiftly enough
	L2: Spectacles of this depth, there will be plenty more ahead
}

ShenyoYharonGift: {
	L0: A blaze burning for who knows how many years, extinguished at last
	L1: Fire and storm never mix, forcing them together comes to nothing
	L2: Feathers soaked through will never lift again, as it should be
}
